@startuml seq-checkin
title In-class check-in

actor Student
participant "Student page" as UI
participant "HTTP API" as API
participant "net.client_ip" as NET
participant CheckinBook as CB
participant ScreenQrService as QR
actor Lecturer

Lecturer -> API : sign in with key, open lesson
API --> Lecturer : greeting, join QR, live barcode
Student -> UI : scan join QR, pick name, "בכיתה"
UI -> API : POST /join {entry_id, mode}
API -> NET : real client IP
NET --> API : inside campus ranges?
alt off campus
  API --> UI : 403 not_on_campus_network
else on campus
  API -> CB : join -> pending_barcode
  API --> UI : session key (once)
end
Student -> UI : hold camera 2 s on live barcode
UI -> API : signed POST /barcode {codes}
API -> NET : campus check again
API -> CB : submit_barcode
CB -> QR : verify_sequence\n(>=5 codes, 2 s, <=6 s old, room, order)
QR --> CB : ok / qr_static / qr_short / qr_stale
CB -> CB : single use + resolve duplicate name
alt name conflict
  CB --> UI : repick / email_code / lecturer_decision
else free
  API --> UI : needs_area
  Student -> UI : pick area
  UI -> API : signed POST /area
  API --> UI : present, "ברוך הבא <name>"
  API --> Lecturer : dashboard ✓, map
end
@enduml
